{% extends "pages/licence/pdf-layout.njk" %}

{% set offenderName = licence.forename + " " + licence.surname %}
{% set pageTitle = offenderName %}

{% set appointmentDate %}
    {% if licence.appointmentTimeType === 'SPECIFIC_DATE_TIME' %}
    <span id="appointment-time" data-qa="appointment-time">on
        <span class="bold">{{ licence.appointmentTime | datetimeToDateWithDay }}
        at
        {{ licence.appointmentTime | datetimeTo12HourTimeCompact }}</span>
    </span>
    {% elif licence.appointmentTimeType === 'NEXT_WORKING_DAY_2PM' %}
    <span id="appointment-time" data-qa="appointment-time">
        <span class="bold">by 2pm on the next working day after you leave prison</span>
    </span>
    {% elif licence.appointmentTimeType === 'IMMEDIATE_UPON_RELEASE' %}
    <span id="appointment-time" data-qa="appointment-time">
        <span class="bold">as soon as you leave prison</span>
    </span>
    {% else %}
    <span id="appointment-time" data-qa="appointment-time"></span>
    {% endif %}
{% endset %}

{% set appointmentAddressLines = licence.licenceAppointmentAddress | formatLicenceAddressAsList if licence.licenceAppointmentAddress else licence.appointmentAddress | formatAddressAsList %}

{% block content %}
  <div id="title" class="title">Licence for {{ offenderName }}</div>
  <div id="subtitle" class="subtitle">Released from {{ licence.prisonDescription }}</div>

  <div id="section-heading-first-meeting" class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-heading__icon-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">Icon</span>
    <span>Your first probation meeting</span>
  </div>

  <div id="first-probation-meeting-content" class="first-probation-meeting-content">
    <div id="first-meeting-person-details">
      <p>You must go to the following address {{ appointmentDate | safe }} and ask to speak to
        {% if licence.appointmentPersonType === 'RESPONSIBLE_COM' %}
          <span id="appointment-contact">
            <span class="bold">{{ licence.responsibleComFullName }}</span>, who will be your supervising officer:
          </span>
        {% elif licence.appointmentPersonType === 'DUTY_OFFICER' %}
          <span id="appointment-contact">the <span class="bold">duty officer</span>:</span>
        {% else %}
          <span id="appointment-contact"><span class="bold">{{ licence.appointmentPerson }}</span>:</span>
        {% endif %}
      </p>
      <div id="appointment-address">
        {% for addressLine in appointmentAddressLines %}
          {% if loop.last %}
            <span class="line-space-after">{{ addressLine }}</span>
          {% else %}
            <span class="line-space-after">{{ addressLine | toAddressCase }},</span>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="first-meeting-person-details-content">
      <p>Your first probation meeting is a chance for you to learn more about your licence period and to ask any questions.</p>
    </div>

    {% if licence.appointmentPersonType === 'DUTY_OFFICER' %}
      <div id="first-meeting-duty-officer-content">
        <p>The duty officer helps people when their supervising officer is unavailable. You will meet your supervising officer at a later appointment.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div id="problems-questions-content">
      <p class="bold">If you have any problems or questions</p>
      <p id="appointment-telephone-details">
        Phone number:
        <span id="appointment-phone-number" class="bold">{{ licence.appointmentTelephoneNumber }}</span>
        {% if licence.appointmentAlternativeTelephoneNumber %}
          <span id="appointment-alternative-phone" class="line-space-after">
            Alternative phone number:
            <span id="appointment-alternative-phone-number" class="bold">{{ licence.appointmentAlternativeTelephoneNumber }}</span>
          </span>
        {% endif %}
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

    <div id="page-2-break" class="page-break-before"></div>

    <div id="section-heading-licence-conditions" class="section-heading">
        <span class="section-heading__icon-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">Icon</span>
        <span>Your licence conditions</span>
    </div>
        <div id="licence-conditions-explanation" class="licence-conditions">
        <p class="bold">What are licence conditions?</p>
        <p>Licence conditions tell you what you must and must not do while on licence.</p>
        <p>Your supervising officer can change some of these conditions. Any changes will be explained to you.</p>
        <p>Some conditions can be made less strict or removed if you are doing well. If you do not follow your licence conditions, conditions can be added or made stricter.</p>
        <p>Read the conditions starting on the next page carefully.</p>
        <p>Ask your supervising officer any questions you have.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="licence-conditions-recall" class="licence-conditions">
        <p class="bold">Recall to prison</p>
        <p>If you do not follow your licence conditions, your supervising officer will need to consider whether you
            should be sent back to prison. This is called being recalled.</p>
        <p>You may commit an offence called being unlawfully at large if:</p>
        <ul class="recall-condition-list">
            <li>a decision is made to recall you to prison and you do not return, or</li>
            <li>you remain out of contact with your supervising officer for 6 months after that decision is made</li>
        </ul>
        <p >This can result in a fine, a prison sentence of up to 2 years, or both.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="licence-conditions-drug-testing" class="licence-conditions">
        <p class="bold">Drug testing</p>
        <p>If asked, you must have a drug test, whether or not you have previously used drugs. You must not do anything to stop or interfere with this test.</p>
    </div>

{% endblock %}
